    description: Some("Two anglers fish from opposite docks, dropping their lines to hook fish swimming at six depths — the fat six-pounders lurk at the bottom, where the reward is biggest and the shark most dangerous. When something bites you reel fast to beat the shark to your catch (only one line can land a fish at a time), racing your rival to be first to a total of 99 pounds."),
